OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening then a mainly dry night
OL,7,Fwith some clear spells. A few showers
OL,8,Fmay then spread to western Argyll by
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA bright and mainly dry day
OL,12,Fwith some sunny intervals at times.
OL,13,FThere could be the odd brief heavy
OL,14,Fshower, mostly over Argyll. Very warm
OL,15,For hot.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,18,FThursday mainly bright and sunny,
OL,19,Fchance of showers in far west. Friday
OL,20,Fand Saturday cloudier and cooler with
OL,21,Fa few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
